  "scope": "Home search keydown only. Plain unmodified Enter or navigation while nativeEvent.isComposing, legacy keyCode229, or already defaultPrevented. No recording, active dialog, terminal, Option-chord suppression or custom keybinding override.",
  "upstream_guard_review": [
    "Home input has a direct local React handler. App has no onKeyDownCapture wrapper and supplies no event adapter to AllWorkspaces.",
    "Global createKeyListeners dispatches plain Enter/arrows. Without key capture/default app handler match, dispatcher passes without preventing or stopping propagation.",
    "App default shell registrations have no bare Enter/Home/End/Arrow binding. Plain keys registered by chat/onboarding/diff belong to those mounted views, not Home.",
    "Provider select-all interception exempts the focused input. compositionstart capture only prevents with recording or recent Option suppression, excluded in the same-input case.",
    "Even if another layer handled an event, the retained root checks defaultPrevented while current local Home handler does not."
  ],
